# ---------- Operator-supplied reference data ----------
# Datasets an operator mounts rather than the product shipping: the India Post PIN codes are
# ~19,000 rows that change without notice, so a copy in the repository is stale the week it lands.
# infra/seed/README.md documents the format and stays committed.
infra/seed/*
!infra/seed/README.md

